WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.650
In Matthew's Gospel, the risen
Jesus gives his followers a command:

2
00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:07.940
go and make disciples of all nations.

3
00:00:07.990 --> 00:00:10.510
Christians call it the Great Commission.

4
00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:15.000
Some answer it by preaching,
telling others about Jesus in words.

5
00:00:15.050 --> 00:00:19.640
Others run food banks at home,
or clinics and schools far away.

6
00:00:19.690 --> 00:00:23.890
So is a Christian who never
preaches still spreading her faith?

7
00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:28.180
In this mission, you'll pull apart
two words that are easily confused:

8
00:00:28.230 --> 00:00:30.430
mission and evangelism.

9
00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:34.320
Then you'll follow mission
locally, nationally and globally,

10
00:00:34.370 --> 00:00:37.880
from a parish course to
churches across the world.

11
00:00:37.930 --> 00:00:42.680
Your mission: decide whether a Christian
can spread her faith without preaching.
